    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The arrest of a digital content creator in Seoul followed the intentional dissemination of fabricated claims against actor Kim Soo-hyun, motivated by profit. The case hinged on the creation of digital evidence, including AI-generated audio and manipulated screenshots. This led to a professional impact from the controversy, halting the actor's public engagements since early 2025. The sequence illustrates how procedural verification by authorities can move to restore order when confronted with misinformation.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
