      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In a jurisdiction of verified fact, the apprehension of the evidence fabricator marked the conclusion of an investigation into unverified allegations motivated by profit. The subject of the claims, a public figure, suffered career disruption as a direct consequence of the scandal. This outcome underscores the enforcement action taken against deceptive practice, affirming the role of legal authorization obtained in distinguishing fact from fabrication.",
