    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "An investigation by the investigative authority into the use of AI tools to create disputed content culminated in legal authorization obtained. The affected party, a celebrity, endured reputational damage as a consequence of scandal, disrupting endorsements and appearances. The case demonstrates the consequence of crime when accusations made for personal benefit are met with law enforcement action, establishing a clear chronology of cause and effect.",
